{"name":"Guardian Angel","hex":"#e4e1ea","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"guardian angel","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A tutelary angel watching over a particular person (and sometimes rescuing them) in monotheistic contexts.","A person who benevolently watches over another or rescues them."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/guardian_angel"}],"entries":[{"title":"Guardian angel","blocks":[{"text":"A guardian angel is a type of angel that is assigned to protect and guide a particular person, group or nation. Belief in tutelary beings can be traced throughout all antiquity. The idea of angels that guard over people played a major role in Ancient Judaism. In Christianity, the hierarchy of angels was extensively developed in the 5th century by Pseudo-Dionysius the Areopagite. The theology of angels and tutelary spirits has undergone many changes since the 5th century. The belief is that guardian angels serve to protect whichever person God assigns them to. The Memorial of the Holy Guardian Angels is celebrated on 2 October."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Bernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg/330px-Bernhard_Plockhorst_-_Schutzengel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guardian_angel","wikidata":"Q728388"},{"title":"Guardian Angel (web series)","blocks":[{"text":"Guardian Angel is a 2018 Hong Kong insurance drama produced by Shaw Brothers Studio. It stars Michael Miu, Bosco Wong, Annie Liu and Kate Tsui as the main cast, with Benz Hui, Hugo Ng, Alex Lam, MC Jin, Mimi Kung as the major supporting cast."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/c/c2/%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E7%A5%9E%E4%B9%8B%E4%BF%9D%E9%9A%AA%E8%AA%BF%E6%9F%A5.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Guardian_Angel_(web_series)","wikidata":"Q56025599"},{"title":"Angel","blocks":[{"text":"An angel is a spiritual, heavenly, or supernatural entity, often depicted as humanoid with bird-like wings, frequently in the role as a messenger or intermediary between God and humanity in various traditions like the Abrahamic religions. Other roles include protectors and guides for humans, such as guardian angels, and servants of God. In Western belief-systems the term is often used to distinguish benevolent from malevolent intermediary beings."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/02/Angel_of_the_Annunciation_MET_DP167921.jpg/330px-Angel_of_the_Annunciation_MET_DP167921.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angel","wikidata":"Q235113"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Cortona_Guardian_Angel_01.jpg/500px-Cortona_Guardian_Angel_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/aa/Cortona_Guardian_Angel_01.jpg/500px-Cortona_Guardian_Angel_01.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Guardian Angel by Pietro da Cortona, 1656","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACortona_Guardian_Angel_01.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Antonsplatz_22.JPG/500px-Antonsplatz_22.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Antonsplatz_22.JPG/1280px-Antonsplatz_22.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6a/Antonsplatz_22.JPG/500px-Antonsplatz_22.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Schutzengel-Mosaik (1907) am Hauptportal der Antonskirche, Antonsplatz, Wien-Favoriten/guardian angel mosaic (1907) at the main portal of St. Anthony's Church, Antonsplatz, Vienna-Favoriten","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAntonsplatz_22.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/Fridolin_Leiber_-_Schutzengel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/Fridolin_Leiber_-_Schutzengel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"A guardian angel in a 19th-century print by Fridolin Leiber","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFridolin_Leiber_-_Schutzengel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Tankard-guardian-angel.jpg/500px-Tankard-guardian-angel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/65/Tankard-guardian-angel.jpg/500px-Tankard-guardian-angel.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Guarding angel on a vintage tankard","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ATankard-guardian-angel.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Guardian_angel_feast%2C_fondachelli_f._sicily.JPG/500px-Guardian_angel_feast%2C_fondachelli_f._sicily.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Guardian_angel_feast%2C_fondachelli_f._sicily.JPG/1280px-Guardian_angel_feast%2C_fondachelli_f._sicily.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1c/Guardian_angel_feast%2C_fondachelli_f._sicily.JPG/500px-Guardian_angel_feast%2C_fondachelli_f._sicily.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The celebration of the Guardian Angel at Fondachelli-Fantina on second Sunday of July, Sicily","link":"https://en.wikipedi